# DAM Design System Rhythm

**Skip-kills (hard bans):**

- Do not copy Geex `style.css` sidebar nav sizing as truth — edit `--dam-sidebar-nav-*` in tokens/primitives.
- Do not edit unlinked `assets/css/sidebar.css` for nav spacing.
- No raw hex for brand/surface/text — use `--dam-*` tokens.
- Do not restyle frozen card anatomy in panel sheets — owner is `dam-brand.css` (`.dam-viz-card__body`).
- Do not treat a zero-byte or undimensioned PNG as vision proof — record actual WxH and Read the image.
- Do not dodge Polish glyphs or leave one-letter orphans unbound in user-facing copy.

**Token ladder:** `dam-tokens.css` → `dam-primitives.css` / `dam-brand.css` → panel sheets (`dam-viz.css`, `dam-branding.css`). Panel CSS must not win with one-off padding.

**Unbound copy:** Wire new user-facing strings through `dam-i18n.js` or match surrounding panel conventions — no orphan hard-coded PL/EN in one HTML file only.
